1355 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Software Engineer \174 Chubb\054 Jersey City\054 NJ                                                                                                                                         Mar 2025 \055 Present                               \nLed the upgrade of Chubb Marketplace from Angular 7 to Angular 20\054 implementing micro frontend architecture and NgRx Store to enhance scalability\054 modularity\054 and code reusability across multiple teams and projects\056\nImplemented and tested scalable Redux\055based state management with Jest\054 ensuring predictable application behavior and maintaining 80\045\053 code coverage across core workflows\056\nLeveraged Claude Code to accelerate development workflows\054 including code generation\054 refactoring\054 and debugging\054 improving delivery speed and code quality\056\nDesigned and launched a unified quote\055ingestion interface for SEMCI workflows\054 consolidating fragmented submission paths into a scalable workflow that reduced operational complexity and improved maintainability\056\nMentored team members in configuring their development environments and provided comprehensive guidance on understanding frontend code repositories\054 accelerating onboarding and boosting team productivity\056\n\nSoftware Engineer Associate \174 Chubb\054 Jersey City\054 NJ                                                                                                                    Jun 2022 \055 Mar 2025\nDesigned\054 developed\054 and tested Angular applications for Chubb Marketplace and Cyber Central\054 maintaining best practices and a cohesive brand across various business lines\056\nContributed transformative redesign efforts to revamp the product quoting experience for businesses operating across multiple locations by streamlining routing and form handling\054 resulting in a 67\045 system performance improvement\056\nPresented in multiple sprint reviews\054 displaying clear understanding and demonstration of UI enhancements and ability to translate technical work to business stakeholders\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 1356 0 R
     /Pg 1343 0 R
     /S /Span
